\langle \mathcal{A}_{\rho,a,b}\psi,\varphi\rangle_{H}
&=\int_{\mathbb{R}}
\left(
\frac{\rho(x)a(x)}{2}\psi''(x)
+\left(\frac{\rho(x)a'(x)}{2}+b(x)\right)\psi'(x)
\right)\varphi(x)\,\frac{dx}{\rho(x)}\\
&=\frac12\int_{\mathbb{R}} a(x)\psi''(x)\varphi(x)\,dx
+\int_{\mathbb{R}}\psi'(x)\left(\frac{a'(x)}{2}
+\frac{b(x)}{\rho(x)}\right)\varphi(x)\,dx\\
&=: I_1+I_2.
\end{align*}

Since $\varphi$ and $\psi$ have compact support, all boundary terms vanish.

For $I_1$, an ...","release_manifest_digest":"sha256:5c6701275ac7dea52a15861e6a3479489a7a0c5730e5c928b81d1c788dfff15c","revision_digest":"sha256:c50e69ea9329cdc6087f14a116339f8850bb185496ce1a51a28ca4ccd11adf1e","source_id":"arxiv:2604.02998","source_revision":"tex-as-downloaded-2026-09-07","statement_fidelity_reviewed":false,"supersedes":[],"trust_class":"curated_secondary","truth_status":"unverified"}

