  Assume that $k_m^{2p-2} \leq \frac{p^2 C^2}{(p-1-\lambda)^2 + p^2 C^2}$. By Corollary~(cor: global lower bound for km of the paper) we have equality, and $(\lambda,C^2)$ lies also in $\{r_\mathcal{C}=0\}$, which contradicts Proposition~(prop: global growth of Delta z=0 of the","release_manifest_digest":"sha256:7a40efa6a83790c5f189dcf4041427245432abe98723548ff2fa90191cba6b6b","revision_digest":"sha256:c663c55745a36979542b730a20fef648390d5c31c285e96a5e4258f34b52da2f","source_id":"arxiv:2609.02073","source_revision":"tex-as-downloaded-2026-09-08","statement_fidelity_reviewed":false,"supersedes":[],"trust_class":"curated_secondary","truth_status":"unverified"}

