[Lemma T5.10 of arXiv:2512.18990, '\bf Hybrid Stochastic Functional Differential Equations with Infinite Delay: Approximation'] Let Assumptions (A5.4 of the paper), (A5.5 of the paper), (A5.6 of the paper) hold and $\mu_8, \mu_9\in\mathcal{P}_r$. Then for any $\Delta\in(0, 1]$
\begin{eqnarray}

  \mathbb{E}|x^k(t)-\bar X^k_\Delta(t)|^2 &\le& C\Delta,\ \  \forall\ t\in [0, T].
