[Lemma lem: DivLength of arXiv:2603.26932, 'On the satisfaction frequency of spectral characterization conditions'] Fix a monic polynomial $\beta \in \bbZ[x]$ with $\operatorname{deg}(\beta)\geq 1$ and irreducible reduction in $\bbF_p$.
    Then, 
    \begin{equation}
    \max\bigl\{k\geq 0: \beta(x)^k \mid \varphi_{\bM}(x) \bmod p \bigr\} =
    \operatorname{Length}_{R_{p,\beta}/pR_{p,\beta}}\biggl(
    \coker\Bigl(\frac{(\bM - x\bI)_{p,\beta}}{p 
            \coker(\bM - x\bI)_{p,\beta}}
            \Bigr) \biggr). 
    \end{equation}

