[Lemma 4 of arXiv:2608.23301, 'On a Telegraph Process with Generalized Mittag-Leffler Waiting times and Velocity Driven b'] Conditional on the event that the initial velocity is $v_1$, the distribution of $n$th event time of counting process $\{\mathcal{N}(t)\}_{t\geq0}$ associated with $X_{\alpha}(t)$ is given by
		\begin{align*}
			F_{T_n|S_{0}}(t|v_1)&=\lambda\sum_{k=0}^{n-1}\binom{n-1}{k}(k+1)p^{k}(1-p)^{n-k-1}\nonumber\\
			&\hspace{2.5cm} \cdot \sum_{i=0}^{n-k-1}\sum_{j=0}^{k}(-1)^{i+j}\binom{n-k-1}{i}\binom{k}{j} H^{\alpha}_{\alpha,1}(-\lambda(j+1),-\mu i;t).
		\end{align*}

