[Lemma lem:Vdev of arXiv:2511.10630, 'Cutoff for generalised Bernoulli--Laplace urn models'] Suppose $\mathbf{x} \in \mathrm{Meso}(N)$. Then, for all $t \geqslant 0$ and $\Delta > 0$, we have
    \begin{equation*}
        \P{\abs{V_t(i, j) - \mathbb{E}\!\left[V_t(i, j)\right]} \geqslant \Delta \text{ for some } i \in [d], j \in [m]} \leqslant 2dm \Exp{-\frac{\Delta^2}{8d^2m^2n}}.
    \end{equation*}

