[Lemma SGP of arXiv:2604.22130, 'Reflected Stochastic Differential Equations Driven by $G$-Brownian Motion with Nonlinear C'] Suppose that $\alpha,\beta\in S_G^p(0,T)$ for some $p\geq 1$. Define the process $\gamma$ by
\begin{align*}
\gamma_t:=\sup_{s\in[0,t]}\left[\alpha_s\wedge (\inf_{r\in[s,t]}\beta_r)\right].
\end{align*}
Then, we have $\gamma\in S_G^p(0,T)$.

