The currents \(U^{\alpha A}\) collect \(T_\chi^{\alpha\beta}\) and \(A_\chi^{\alpha\beta\gamma}\). Their Jacobian matrices are
\be
\frac{\del U^{\alpha A}}{\del\Xi_B}
=K^{\alpha AB}
=\frac{\del^3\chi}
{\del\beta_\alpha\del\Xi_A\del\Xi_B}.
