[Lemma 15 ($L^\infty$ decay) of arXiv:2606.24167, '\bf On the stability of rarefaction for stochastic viscous conservation law'] Assume that the conditions of Lemma {\rm{\ref{lm2.4}}} hold. Let $\phi\in X_2(T)$ be the solution of {\rm{(\ref{perturbation})}}. Then  
\begin{eqnarray*}
\mathbb E \| \phi \|_{\infty }  \leq  C(2+t)^{-\frac{1}{4}+\epsilon}, \quad \forall \epsilon>0.
\end{eqnarray*}

