        \hat Q_{h, \epsilon}W / W (x) - 1 \leq -\lambda \gamma h^2\,, \forall x \in \Omega_h \cap B(0, \rho a\sqrt{\epsilon})\,. 
    \end{equation}
    Here, $\rho$ is defined as in~\eqref{e:rho-def}.

