[Prop 14 of arXiv:2609.01101, '2609.01101'] For all sufficiently large $T$, uniformly for $|b_i|\le T/2$,
\begin{equation}
\mathcal M_{1/2}(\tilde F_{\mathbf b})
\gg T B(T,\mathbf b,\mathbf a).
\end{equation}
Here the norm at $1/2$ is the one-sided limit from $\Re s>1/2$.

