	Then, by Lemma \ref{lem: PillShaped} with $R =  r_\delta$ there exists an absolute constant $c$ with
	\begin{equation}
		\bbP\bigl(x_0 + W_{ r_\delta^2} \in \sB(y,\varepsilon) \text{ and } \Vert W_t - (t/ r_\delta^2)(y - x_0)\Vert \leq  \gamma r_\delta, \forall t\leq  r_\delta^2 \bigr) \geq c(\varepsilon/ r_\delta )^2.
