[Lemma phibound of arXiv:2507.10545, 'KPZ equation from a class of nonlinear SPDEs in infinite volume'] \fsp Fix any {\small$\mathrm{D}=\mathrm{O}(1)$} and {\small$\delta>0$} and {\small$\T>0$}, all independent of {\small$N$}. With high probability, we have 

\begin{align}
\sup_{\t\in[0,\T]}\sup_{|\x|\leq N^{\mathrm{D}}}|\bphi_{\t,\x}|\leq N^{\delta}.
\end{align}

