$r \mapsto F(r):=(r_+)^{1+k}$. Since $F$ is locally Lipschitz on $\mathbb R$, the previous contraction
argument applies to
\begin{equation*}
    \partial_t u+\dive\bigl(bF(u)\bigr)=\Delta u.
