[Proposition 11 of arXiv:2512.00213, 'On strong sharp phase transition in the random connection model'] Let $v\in\BX$ and $n\in\N_0$, $m\in\{1,2\}$. Then 
\begin{align*}
V_{n+m}^v \le_{st}  \int V^x_m(\xi^{[n]}_x)\,V^v_n(dx).
\end{align*}
Moreover, we get
\begin{align*}
\Lambda^v_{n+m}\le\int \Lambda^x_m\,\Lambda^v_n(dx).
\end{align*}

