[Lemma 16 of arXiv:2607.26944, 'Improved bounds on the inradius and inverse inradius process of the convex hull of planar '] For every $\alpha \in (0, 1)$ it holds that
    \begin{equation*}
        \Var(\Theta^\sfr) \ge \alpha^2 \big( \E[\Theta^\sfr] \big)^2 \mleft[ 1 - \mleft( 1 - F_R\mleft( \frac{2}{\sqrt{(1+\alpha) \E[\Theta^\sfr]}} \mright) \mright)^2 \mright].
    \end{equation*}
    Furthermore, taking only the first term of the series for $F_R(x)$, setting $\alpha = 0.09$, and using bounds from Theorem~\ref{thm:up_low_exp_inv_inr}, we obtain
    \begin{equation*}
        \Var(\Theta^\sfr) \ge 5.2 \cdot 10^{-11}.
    \end{equation*}

