    \widehat{P}_th_{\alpha-1}(x) = \int_0^\infty \widehat{P}_t\widehat{P}_r\widehat{\nu} h_{\alpha-1}(x)\,{\rm d}r = \int_0^\infty \widehat{P}_{t+r}\widehat{\nu}h_{\alpha-1}(x)\,{\rm d}r = \int_t^\infty ...","release_manifest_digest":"sha256:1a719b2743c8436b058dfc781254616e4a263229ccff05bb9de6ae9fe7a179ac","revision_digest":"sha256:e1aa561396366750c86a6b351db39c28842d9c25b6e6816dc1113854b3726866","source_id":"arxiv:2411.08220","source_revision":"tex-as-downloaded-2026-09-08","statement_fidelity_reviewed":false,"supersedes":[],"trust_class":"curated_secondary","truth_status":"unverified"}

