  q_D^\mathbb{F}(t)\le (1+C_\mathbb{F} t^2)p_\mathbb{F}(t)^2\left(1+\frac{C_\mathbb{F}}{D}\right),\qquad D\ge3,
\end{equation}
and $q_2^\mathbb{F}(t)\le p_\mathbb{F}(t)$.

