\[
 \norm{U_{\tau,f}u}_{L^2(\mu)}^2
 =\int_{S}e^{\kappa\tau f}|u|^2\,d\mu
 =\left\|u\right\|_{L^2(\mu_\tau)}^2.
\]
By (equation eq:abstract-analytic-tilts of the paper) and
(equation eq:abstract-multiplier-inverse-bounds of the paper), multiplication by $m_\tau$ is
an automorphism of the form space.  Hence
\begin{align*}
 u\in U_{\tau,f}V_{\mu_\tau}
