[Lem 32 of arXiv:2609.03821, 'Condensation and Metastability in the Supercritical Two-Species Zero-Range Process via Res'] For each $x\in S_{\star}$,
\begin{align*}
 & \langle F_{N},-\mathcal{L}^{*}_{N}\mathbb{W}_{x}\rangle_{\nu_{N},\mathcal{G}^{x}_{N}}\\
 & =N^{-1-\alpha}\sum_{y\in S_{\star}\setminus\{x\}}\frac{1}{\kappa_{\star}\Gamma(\alpha)\mathcal{I}_{\alpha}}\left(\frac{\rho}{c_{1}(x,y)}+\frac{1-\rho}{c_{2}(x,y)}\right)^{-1}\left[f_{N}(x)-f_{N}(y)\right]+o(\theta^{-1}_{N})+\theta^{-1}_{N}o_{\epsilon}(1),
\end{align*}
where $f_{N}$ is defined at \eqref{eq:fN-def}. (Proof in the paper; no proof environment follows the statement in the TeX.)

