[Lemma 15 of arXiv:2605.31088, 'On couplings for kinetic Langevin diffusions'] Let $z,\tilde z\in\R^{2d}$ and $n\in\N_{>0}$, and let $y_k=(u_k,w_k)$,
$k\in\{0,\ldots,n\}$, be the trajectory defined by~\eqref{eq: def Ek}
and~\eqref{eq: y_k choices optimized trajectory}. The position
components satisfy
\begin{equation}
    |u_k|
    \le |\Delta x|+\frac{he^{-\gamma h/2}}{1-e^{-\gamma h}}(1-e^{-\gamma hn})|\Delta v|
    \le 2\br{1+\frac{hn}{2+\gamma hn}}|\Delta z|,
    \qquad k\in\{0,\ldots,n\}.
\end{equation}

