[Proposition prop_3 of arXiv:2412.03774, '{ Refining Concentration for \\Gaussian Quadratic Chaos with\\ Applications in Sonar and C'] Let $A$ be positive-semidefinite. The inequality in ((en_LM of the paper)) implies HWI at best with
\begin{equation}

\kappa=\frac{9-\sqrt{17}}{32}\approx 0.1524,
\end{equation}
which is achieved for
