[Theorem 5 of arXiv:2605.30737, 'Reducing Kolmogorov’s Reversibility Criterion Via a Basis for the Interaction Graph Kernel'] Given  $\{X_t\}_{t\geq 0}$ a Markov chain with state space $S=\{1,2,\dots, 
N\}$ and infinitesimal generator $Q$, the following is equivalent 
\begin{enumerate}
\item $\Gamma J=0$.
\item $\displaystyle \sum_{i=1}^{j-1}J_{ij}-\sum_{i=j+1}^{N}J_{ji}=0$, for all $j\in S$.
\end{enumerate}

