[Cor mle-goal of arXiv:2411.11676, 'Surface sums for lattice Yang--Mills in the large-$N$ limit'] For all strings $s=\{\ell_1,\dots,\ell_n\}$ and all plaquette assignments  $K:\mathcal{P}_{\mathbb{Z}^d}\to\mathbb{N}$ the following master loop equation at every fixed edge $\mathbf{e}$ in $s$ holds:
\begin{equation}
	\begin{aligned}
		\phi^K(s) &= \sum_{s'\in \mathbb{S}_-(\mathbf{e},s)}\phi^K(s') - \sum_{s'\in \mathbb{S}_+(\mathbf{e},s)}\phi^K(s') 
		\\&+ \upbeta\sum_{s'\in \mathbb{D}_-(\mathbf{e},s)}\phi^K(s') - \upbeta\sum_{s'\in \mathbb{D}_+(\mathbf{e},s)}\phi^K(s'),
	\end{aligned}
\end{equation}
