[Lemma P5.1 of arXiv:2412.09850, 'Averaging principles for time-inhomogeneous multi-scale SDEs via nonautonomous Poisson equ'] Let $h$ be a  bounded and $\tau$-periodic function on $\mathbb{R}$. Then, for any $T>0$,
\begin{align*}
\sup_{a\in\mathbb{R}}\left|\frac{1}{T}\int^{T+a}_a h(s)\,ds-\frac{1}{\tau}\int^{\tau}_0h(s)\,ds\right|\leqslant \frac{2\tau M}{T},
\end{align*}
where $M=\sup_{s\in [0,\tau]}|h(s)|$.

