[Theorem VD-Volterra of arXiv:2507.01406, '{\Large On Iterated Lorenz Curves with Applications: The Multivariate Case }'] Let 
\begin{equation}
(\mathcal{K}f)(x)=\int_{0}^{1/2}K(x,u)f(u)\,du=\int_{0}^{x}f(u)\,du,\qquad
0\leq x\leq \frac{1}{2},  
\end{equation}
