[Lemma lem:powers-of-P of arXiv:2511.01058, 'Limit profiles and cutoff for the Burnside process on Sylow double cosets'] Let \(P\) be the transition kernel for the Sylow--Burnside process when \(k=1\) and let \(\tilde\psi = \frac{1}{pn_1}\mathbf 1_A-\frac{1}{p^2n_2}\mathbf 1_B\). If \(|H\sigma H|=p\), then
