Moreover, it is straight forward that 
$\| F(\phi^{s,x})\|_{\mathcal{C}^0} \leq \| F\|_{\mathcal{C}^0}$ and $\| \nabla F (\phi^{s,x}) \sigma(\phi^{s,x})\|_{\mathcal{C}^0} \leq \| F\|_{\mathcal{C}^1} \| \sigma\|_{\mathcal{C}^0}$, which combined with the above and  ...","release_manifest_digest":"sha256:4c75f6d0537018333faf2797b5710931e9b6df7453af9cf14ad1fb349d74743a","revision_digest":"sha256:f13ef1b858974e7881d105a17c0b722a3694d32d801df92db4228b72aa9f8aac","source_id":"arxiv:2412.01645","source_revision":"tex-as-downloaded-2026-09-08","statement_fidelity_reviewed":false,"supersedes":[],"trust_class":"curated_secondary","truth_status":"unverified"}

