[Proposition prop:one-arm-positive-defect of arXiv:2607.18070, 'The Brownian loop-catcher'] There is a constant \(\Delta_0>0\) such that
\begin{equation}
 \Delta(p)=\Delta_0+O(p),\qquad
 R(p)\sim\frac{\Delta_0}{A_\lambda\Gamma(1+\lambda)}p^{1+\lambda}.
\end{equation}

