			Given that $\mathbb{E}|\Xi_T|^{p_1}=\mathbb{E}^{\tilde{\mathbb{P}}}[\xi_T^{-p_1}]$ (the definitions of $\tilde{\mathbb{P}}$ and $\xi_T$ are given in Theorem (sec3-thm.1 of ...","release_manifest_digest":"sha256:7fce67ba16ab013938af8707177357c18ac2ebc84a737bd67cdff0c3f6753db0","revision_digest":"sha256:f1b34558f8b72835f83f0e87d2a60eaa87170c8769c22e3bd313dabdf33a10ba","source_id":"arxiv:2602.04303","source_revision":"tex-as-downloaded-2026-09-08","statement_fidelity_reviewed":false,"supersedes":[],"trust_class":"curated_secondary","truth_status":"unverified"}

