[Lemma 15 of arXiv:2608.27433, 'Scalar curvature on K\"ahler blow-ups and systolic inequalities'] Let \(k>2\). Suppose $u\in C^{4,\alpha}_\delta(X\setminus S)$, $\delta>4-2k$, and
\begin{equation}
  L_\omega u-\sum_{j=1}^Nu(q_j)\psi_j=0
  \quad\text{on }X\setminus S.
\end{equation}
Then $u=0$.

