[Prop p:B1-B2 of arXiv:2411.12003, 'Central Limit Theorem for non-stationary random products of $\SL(2, \R)$ matrices'] For any $B_1,B_2\in {\mathrm{SL}}(2,{\mathbb R})$, one has
\begin{equation}
\log \|B_1\| + \log \|B_2\| - \log \|B_1B_2\| \le \log 4\sqrt{2} + \log  \min(\Delta_{B_1,B_2}^{-1} , \|B_2\|^2).
\end{equation}

