[Lemma 27 of arXiv:2511.09517, 'From Cannings model to Brownian motion conditioned on local time profile'] Let $1\le m_2\le m_1\le q_n(j)$ and $k_1,\ldots,k_{m_2}\in[1,q_n(j-1)]$ be distinct. Then on the event $\{X_j=m_1\}$,
